when he's gonna go.

00:01:29.506 --> 00:01:31.008
Do you wanna be a part of this, Frank?

00:01:32.968 --> 00:01:35.721
Would you like to be
a part of this history?

00:01:38.475 --> 00:01:39.725
Yes, I would.

00:01:40.518 --> 00:01:42.686
Whatever you need me to do, I'm available.

00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:49.443
He likes to talk, don't he?

